# Peragus, the administration level (TSL, 101PER): the Exile wakes in the
# medical bay, finds Kreia in the morgue, fights through the droids to the
# administration centre, frees Atton and calls T3-M4 on the comm (light
# side answers). Starts from the prologue's checkpoint:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @peragus_start data/routes/tsl/peragus_admin.route --god
# The walkthroughs this follows: Dan Simpson's GameFAQs FAQ (v1.6, its
# [PRAGS] chapter) and GameBanshee's KotOR II locations; the maintainer's
# offline copies are in `context/walkthroughs/tsl/`.
# Goals: launcher::playthrough. Method: docs/PLAYTESTS.md.
# The medical bay: the Exile wakes in kolto tank 3.
say medical bay functions # the medical computer: open the morgue and the
say unlock door to morgue # medical storage room, then log out
say storage
say log out
use MedCom
use MilLowPlstcCylin@1 # the med lab's plasteel container
use MilLowPlstcCylin@4 # the storage room's two containers: medpacs and
use MilLowPlstcCylin@5 # chemicals
use LowCorpse@3      # the morgue's body at the back: the plasma torch; Kreia
                     # wakes and talks (the morgue's alignment trigger)
# Kreia in the morgue: light side answers (DSimpson's K-tree), ending on
# "I'll return soon to make sure you're all right" (LSP)
say I'll return soon
talk
talk                 # then her conversation itself
save peragus_morgue
equip plasmatorch    # the torch in hand: the damaged door south of the morgue
bash MedBayDoor      # struck open
use LowCorpse@4      # the corpse past the door: a vibroblade
use BrokenDroidMining@1 # a broken droid: an optimized droid interface
equip w_melee_05     # the vibroblade in hand
equip                # and what else fits
fight 20             # the hallway's droids, two and two
use 102PERDoor       # the emergency hatch to the mining tunnels: sealed;
                     # Kreia's voice in the Exile's mind
to LowCorpse@1       # the security room
use LowCorpse@1      # its corpse
bash SecLoc          # the locked locker, DC 28: struck open (Security is
use SecLoc           # better, for its XP; this Exile has too little)
say check security records # the security desk's logs: the administration
say administration console # console's "maintenance" (the droids' override)
say log out
use SecTer
use GuardRoomDr      # Kreia warns of the droids in the guard room:
talk                 # Precognition
fight 15             # its three droids; the Exile levels up
bash CivilFootLker@1 # two locked footlockers, struck open: a stealth field
use CivilFootLker@1  # generator, ion grenades, medpacs
bash CivilFootLker@2
use CivilFootLker@2
save peragus_guardroom
# The administration center: six droids, killed for their XP (DSimpson),
# then the console's override switch drops the prison's force field.
to Adm_Console
fight 25
say control override switch
say activate the switch
use Adm_Console
fight 25             # the droids up the lower right ramp
use MilLowPlstcCylin@3 # the ramp's containers
use MilLowPlstcCylin@2
# Atton in the prison (Kreia's vision on the way): Revan light side and a
# man, "I trust you" (LSP), then to the console's comm (DSimpson's A-tree).
say I was led to believe that Revan saved
say Revan was a man
say I trust you
use PrisonRoomDr
talk
until in 101per
save peragus_atton
# The comm: hangar bay 25, T3-M4 answers; play goes to T3 in the hangar.
say access comm system
say =Hangar Bay 25.
say can you read me
use Adm_Console
module 106per        # T3 in the hangar bay
save peragus_t3
